@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# Admin xử lý đơn hàng (CR-QHUY) — docs/admin-orders/api-contract.md.
# Yêu cầu: đã seed (CR-LAN: admin@brewlite.com / Admin@123456, demo@brewlite.test / Demo@12345).
# Chạy lần lượt từ trên xuống. Món dùng: Americano + Trân châu trắng (đủ nguyên liệu,
# tránh "Đào miếng hộp" tồn kho thấp).

### Login ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@brewlite.com", "password": "Admin@123456" }

### Login CUSTOMER
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@brewlite.test", "password": "Demo@12345" }

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Chuẩn bị: lấy món (Americano — xếp đầu theo tên)
# @name products
GET {{base}}/products

@productId = {{products.response.body.data.0.id}}

### Chuẩn bị: lấy topping (Trân châu trắng — tạo đầu tiên)
# @name productDetail
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}

@toppingId = {{productDetail.response.body.data.toppings.0.id}}

### Chuẩn bị: CUSTOMER tạo đơn
# @name createOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "size": "M", "quantity": 2, "toppingIds": ["{{toppingId}}"] }] }

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### Chuẩn bị: CUSTOMER thanh toán MOCK thành công -> PAID
POST {{base}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: admin-orders-{{orderId}}
X-Mock-Outcome: SUCCESS

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "method": "E_WALLET" }

### 1. [200] ADMIN xem danh sách — có đơn vừa trả, đủ tên khách + món + topping, không có giá/email
GET {{base}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. [403] CUSTOMER gọi API admin
GET {{base}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3. [401] Không có token
GET {{base}}/admin/orders

### 4. [200] PAID -> PREPARING ("Bắt đầu pha")
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PAID" }

### 5. [409] Bấm trùng: gửi lại request 4 -> đơn vẫn PREPARING, không nhảy sang READY
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PAID" }

### 6a. [200] PREPARING -> READY ("Pha xong")
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PREPARING" }

### 6b. [200] READY -> COMPLETED ("Đã giao khách")
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "READY" }

### 6c. [200] Đơn COMPLETED đã biến mất khỏi danh sách
GET {{base}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7a. Chuẩn bị: CUSTOMER tạo đơn mới, không thanh toán -> PENDING
# @name pendingOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "size": "S", "quantity": 1 }] }

@pendingId = {{pendingOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### 7b. [409] advance đơn PENDING
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{pendingId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PAID" }

### 7c. Chuẩn bị: CUSTOMER hủy đơn -> CANCELLED (CR-VUHUY hoàn lại nguyên liệu)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{pendingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 7d. [409] advance đơn CANCELLED
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{pendingId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PAID" }

### 8. [404] Id không tồn tại
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/clnotexist000000000000000/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "PAID" }

### 9a. [400] Thiếu expectedStatus
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9b. [400] expectedStatus sai giá trị
PATCH {{base}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "COMPLETED" }

### 10. CUSTOMER xem đơn -> COMPLETED
# Kiểm tra DB: order_status_history có 3 dòng mới changed_by = 'admin' cho đơn này.
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
